          "src/cowabunga_api/data/crud_message.py",
          "src/cowabunga_api/data/crud_api_key.py"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "CRUDAssistant, CRUDVectorStore, and CRUDFileObject override get/list/delete to accept typed filter models (FilterAssistant, FilterVectorStore, FilterFileObject)",
          "CRUDThread, CRUDRun, and CRUDMessage inherit base methods directly and pass raw dict filters like {'id': thread_id}",
          "CRUDAPIKey overrides get/list but still accepts dict | None, not a typed filter model"
        ],
        "suggestion": "Standardize all CRUD subclasses to use typed filter models that convert to dict internally, or remove typed filter subclasses and consistently use dicts across the layer. Pick one pattern and apply it uniformly.",
