        "evidence": [
          "run_experiment contains a tight loop over self.niah_data that writes temp files, uploads via API, creates assistants, creates threads, runs evals, scores results, and mutates instance state (self.current_file, self.current_assistant)",
          "In-place dataset mutation via self.niah_data.add_column() is scattered at the end of the method after the loop",
