    "review::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::duplicated-grpc-proto-contract": {
      "id": "review::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::duplicated-grpc-proto-contract",
      "detector": "review",
      "file": ".",
      "tier": 1,
      "confidence": "high",
      "summary": "gRPC proto contract duplicated verbatim at legacy/cowabunga_sdk/proto and rust/proto with two independent generators and no sync enforcement",
      "detail": {
        "holistic": true,
        "dimension": "cross_module_architecture",
        "related_files": [
          "legacy/cowabunga_sdk/proto/cowabunga_sdk/chat/chat.proto",
          "rust/proto/cowabunga_sdk/chat/chat.proto",
          "Makefile",
          "rust/crates/sdk/build.rs"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "diff -rq of the two proto trees is byte-identical today, yet both trees are independently canonical: the Makefile gen-python target (Makefile:26-31) generates from legacy/cowabunga_sdk/proto while the Rust SDK compiles from rust/proto via crates/sdk/build.rs.",
          "The SDK wheel every packages/* backend builds against ships committed pb2 files generated from the legacy copy (legacy/cowabunga_sdk/Dockerfile copies only ./legacy/cowabunga_sdk), while the deployed API (packages/api/Dockerfile) builds Rust clients generated from the rust copy \u2014 nothing in CI compares the trees.",
          "Both copies still declare option go_package = \"github.com/defenseunicorns/leapfrogai/...\", showing neither side is regenerated from a checked single source of truth; a field or service added to only one copy silently desynchronizes the API<->backend gRPC contract across the migration boundary."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Make rust/proto/cowabunga_sdk the single canonical copy: delete legacy/cowabunga_sdk/proto/cowabunga_sdk, repoint the Makefile gen-python -I flag at rust/proto, regenerate and commit the *_pb2.py files, and add a make check-proto step (diff of generated outputs, run in CI) that fails on drift.",
        "reasoning": "",
        "summary_hash": "e8f725a1"
      },
      "status": "open",
      "note": null,
      "first_seen": "2026-09-12T15:16:58+00:00",
      "last_seen": "2026-09-12T15:16:58+00:00",
      "resolved_at": null,
      "reopen_count": 0,
