          "CRUDAPIKey.get/list (crud_api_key.py:97-140) re-implement the base's select-plus-filter loop (crud_base.py:142-181) instead of calling super() \u2014 confirmed signal b03467b7698cf3f0 (crud_api_key.py:100 == crud_base.py:61 window).",
