          "turso_client.py:511-530 - on 'no such function: vector_distance_cos', 'no such index', or ANY httpx.HTTPError, it calls _fallback_brute_force, which loads every vector of the store and scores in Python (lines 532-567) - with no log line anywhere in the fallback path.",
