          "chat_types.py:20 types ChatMessage.role as Literal['user','assistant','system','function'], duplicating lfai.ChatRole values (chat_pb2.pyi:9-14); helpers.grpc_chat_role (helpers.py:97-109) then converts strings back to the enum at runtime, returning Optional that callers never narrow (chat.py:42,72)."
