          "legacy/cowabunga_api/routers/openai/chat.py"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "chat.py:29 declares chat_complete -> 'ChatCompletionResponse | StreamingResponse'; composer.py:202 assigns 'chat_response: ChatCompletionResponse = await chat_complete(...)' and then dereferences chat_response.choices[0] (composer.py:217).",
          "Safety relies on the incidental call-site fact that stream=request.stream is falsy here; any future caller passing stream=True gets a StreamingResponse crash that the annotation says cannot happen."
